y15
[half-time kick] yt
[v0 l1 v5 l1] x0,8
[=127,0] x15

# Pattern 16: Acid Filter Resonance Sweep Lane (over 4 bars, 64 steps)
y16
[acid sweep] yt
[v8 k350] x0
[v8 k650] x8
[v8 k1100] x16
[v8 k1800] x24
[v8 k2600] x32
[v8 k3600] x40
[v8 k4800] x48
